      "message": "I think it\u0027d be more straightforward to just track the remaining budget instead of max + current, then we don\u0027t need to worry about overflow etc.\n\n```\nbool SkCodec::allocateFromBudget(size_t numBytes) {\n    if (numBytes \u003e fAllocBudget)\n        return false;\n\n    fAllocBudget -\u003d numBytes;\n    return true;\n}\n```",
